# Rejection briefs are TRACKED on purpose: they are the feedback loop's only durable
# carrier, and an untracked brief dies with the machine that wrote it.
#
# This file is DOCUMENTATION, not a mechanism. Nothing here re-includes anything: no
# ancestor rule currently ignores .claude/knowledge/, and if one ever did, git could not
# re-include a path underneath an excluded DIRECTORY from here anyway -- the fix would
# have to be an un-ignore of the directory itself, in the repo root .gitignore. The
# negations below are kept only to state the intent at the place someone will look.
!*.md
!INDEX.jsonl
